# Goal: Sequential endstop alignment for actuators
#
# Motors align sequentially (one left/right pair at a time) to avoid collisions.
# Left + right sides of the same joint align simultaneously (separate CAN buses).
# Empty name list = align all actuators.
string[] name
---
# Result: Final outcome after completion
bool success
string message
string[] succeeded_name
string[] failed_name
string[] failed_reason
---
# Feedback: Progress updates during operation
string status
uint32 current_step
uint32 total_steps
string[] current_joints
